o what the hunter does and age over time. A trained dog helps in the field, and licensed gear from real brands such as Remington and Browning covers firearms, bows and crossbows.\n\nThe loop centers on tracking animals, choosing equipment and taking considered shots. The game is single-player with full controller support, and it suits players who enjoy hunting and outdoors simulation and want a large map to explore at their own pace."}}